{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44129734",
      "title": "Adding Validation Styles",
      "lectureOrder": 248,
      "videoOrder": 236,
      "sourceHash": "c33839b45a5dde0ac03820efe44cb5aea6584abaeec674f9514d6c8fddc9541b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.79,
          "en": "So we're using-some form information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.79,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "and some control specific information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 7.26,
          "en": "to show this error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.26,
          "end": 11.4,
          "en": "Of course, we can improve validation either further here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.4,
          "end": 16.23,
          "en": "For example, we might wanna mark the invalid inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.23,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "as invalid visually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 21.87,
          "en": "and Angular actually helps us with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.87,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "If you inspect an input field that was registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "with ng-model, you'll see that on there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 33.92,
          "en": "some special CSS classes have been added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.536,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "And these are CSS classes that are added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 40.32,
          "en": "and managed by Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.32,
          "end": 44.52,
          "en": "because we added ng-model on that input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.52,
          "end": 47.64,
          "en": "And it's always in the end, these three classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.64,
          "end": 51.363,
          "en": "and their counterparts that are added by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.32,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "ng-Pristine tells you whether this email field has",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 60.18,
          "en": "received any input from the user or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.18,
          "end": 64.5,
          "en": "So if ng-Pristine is added, it has not received any input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 67.23,
          "en": "ng-invalid tells you whether it's currently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.23,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "considered valid or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 70.8,
          "en": "In this case, it's not valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.8,
          "end": 74.03999999999999,
          "en": "It would be an ng-valid if it would be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.03999999999999,
          "end": 76.47,
          "en": "and ng-touched tells you whether the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.47,
          "end": 78.12,
          "en": "at least selected it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.12,
          "end": 79.86,
          "en": "So here it's touched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.86,
          "end": 82.856,
          "en": "I have ng-touched on it because I did click in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.856,
          "end": 85.56,
          "en": "but I haven't typed a single character.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.56,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "So it's still pristine and it's invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 92.16,
          "en": "because currently the value entered here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.16,
          "end": 93.993,
          "en": "doesn't meet my validators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.25,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "The other input here, the password input, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 103.11,
          "en": "is pristine and has also been touched and is also invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.11,
          "end": 106.97999999999999,
          "en": "If I reload though, then you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.97999999999999,
          "end": 109.71000000000001,
          "en": "that it has ng-untouched on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 111.90299999999999,
          "en": "because I haven't tapped into it yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.03999999999999,
          "end": 116.564,
          "en": "And of course you can use these classes for styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.564,
          "end": 120.87,
          "en": "That's why I prepared a new styles.CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.87,
          "end": 122.52,
          "en": "which you find attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.52,
          "end": 126.202,
          "en": "which is essentially the old styles.CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.202,
          "end": 131.202,
          "en": "but it has some special validation styles added to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 136.38,
          "en": "Some special rules that in the end use the ng-invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 139.74,
          "en": "and ng-touched and so on information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.74,
          "end": 143.34,
          "en": "to style these inputs depending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.34,
          "end": 145.35,
          "en": "on whether they're valid or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.35,
          "end": 149.103,
          "en": "and whether the user has interacted with them or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.24,
          "end": 154.65,
          "en": "So with these styles added, if I now reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.65,
          "end": 157.02,
          "en": "and I tap in there and here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.02,
          "end": 159.36,
          "en": "you see at the moment nothing-happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.36,
          "end": 161.13,
          "en": "because even though I selected them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.13,
          "end": 163.29,
          "en": "I haven't entered anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.29,
          "end": 166.23,
          "en": "But if I now enter an invalid email, for example, you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.23,
          "end": 167.939,
          "en": "that gets highlighted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.939,
          "end": 171.03,
          "en": "and the same is true for an invalid password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 174.69,
          "en": "and this special styling-disappears as soon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 176.28300000000002,
          "en": "as I enter a valid value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.78,
          "end": 180.81,
          "en": "If I reload and enter something-for the first time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.81,
          "end": 185.55,
          "en": "the invalid styling-is only applied once I tap out of there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.55,
          "end": 187.983,
          "en": "which is the behavior I want to have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.3,
          "end": 192.09,
          "en": "Of course, we can now also improve the error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.09,
          "end": 196.376,
          "en": "and show more specific error information down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.376,
          "end": 198.69,
          "en": "So in the log in component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.69,
          "end": 202.8,
          "en": "we can check if the email has been touched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.8,
          "end": 205.65,
          "en": "and the email is dirty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.65,
          "end": 208.68,
          "en": "which means the user entered at least some character in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.68,
          "end": 212.67000000000002,
          "en": "there and the email is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.67000000000002,
          "end": 217.67000000000002,
          "en": "And in that case I'll output invalid email address entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 223.29,
          "en": "And in addition, I'll output another control error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 223.29,
          "end": 226.77,
          "en": "or paragraph where I'll check if the password has been",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.77,
          "end": 229.38,
          "en": "touched and the password is dirty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.38,
          "end": 231.127,
          "en": "and the password is invalid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.127,
          "end": 236.066,
          "en": "in which case I'll output invalid password entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 236.066,
          "end": 241.066,
          "en": "must be at least six characters long.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.504,
          "end": 246.18,
          "en": "And with those changes in place, if we go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.18,
          "end": 248.781,
          "en": "we still don't see those messages initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.781,
          "end": 252.21,
          "en": "but if I enter an invalid email address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 252.21,
          "end": 255.069,
          "en": "I see the email specific message now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 255.069,
          "end": 258.843,
          "en": "and if I enter an invalid password, I also see that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 260.285,
          "end": 261.51,
          "en": "And that's arguably now a better way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.51,
          "end": 263.733,
          "en": "of giving-the user feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 264.72,
          "end": 269.01,
          "en": "Of course, if I enter valid values, those messages disappear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 269.01,
          "end": 273.003,
          "en": "and I can submit my form and access the values there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 273.96,
          "end": 276.87,
          "en": "This log, as you saw before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 276.87,
          "end": 279.93,
          "en": "is coming-from inside the on set method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.93,
          "end": 283.113,
          "en": "and we only make it there if the form is not invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
